%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%% unips/essitd/unips-essitd-defaults.clo
%% NOVA thesis configuration file
